    <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
      <name>InformationDisplayMode</name>
      <id>133</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Information records</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>رکوردهای اطلاعاتی</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Сведения</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Bilgiler</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Thông tin</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Information records</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Information records</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
        <segments>InformationDisplayMode</segments>
      </dataPath>
      <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
      <handlers>
        <event>OnChange</event>
        <name>InformationDisplayModeOnChange</name>
      </handlers>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>InformationDisplayModeExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>135</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>If the &lt;b>As&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>of&lt;/> mode is selected, information records are taken as of the document date. If the &lt;b>Latest&lt;/> mode is selected, the latest information records are taken. If the &lt;b>Hide&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> mode is selected, information records are not received, and the filter by information records is not available.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>اگر حالت &lt;b>تا&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>تاریخ&lt;/> انتخاب شود، رکوردهای اطلاعاتی در تاریخ سند گرفته می‌شوند. اگر حالت &lt;b>آخرین&lt;/> انتخاب شود، آخرین رکوردهای اطلاعاتی گرفته می‌شوند. اگر حالت &lt;b>پنهان&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> انتخاب شود، رکوردهای اطلاعاتی دریافت نمی‌شوند و فیلتر بر اساس رکوردهای اطلاعاتی در دسترس نیست.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Если выбран режим &lt;b>На&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>дату&lt;/>, то сведения берутся на дату документа.
Если выбран режим &lt;b>Последние&lt;/>, то берутся последние сведения.
Если выбран режим &lt;b>Не&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>показывать&lt;/>, то не будет выполняться получение сведений и не будет доступен отбор по сведениям.
</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Eğer &lt;b>Şu&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>tarihe kadar&lt;/> modu seçilmiş ise, bilgiler belge tarihi itibarıyla alınır.
 &lt;b>Son&lt;/> modu seçilmiş ise, en son bilgiler alınır.
 &lt;b>Gösterilmesin&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> modu seçilmiş ise, bilgiler getirilmeyecek ve bilgilere göre seçim yapılamayacaktır.
</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Nếu đã chọn chế độ &lt;b>Đến&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>ngày&lt;/>, thì thông tin được lấy vào ngày chứng từ.
Nếu đã chọn chế độ &lt;b>Gần nhất&lt;/>, thì sẽ lấy thông tin gần nhất.
Nếu đã chọn chế độ &lt;b>Không&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>hiển thị&lt;/>, thì sẽ không thực hiện nhận thông tin và không sử dụng bộ lọc theo thông tin.
</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>If the &lt;b>As&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>of&lt;/> mode is selected, information records are taken as of the document date. If the &lt;b>Latest&lt;/> mode is selected, the latest information records are taken. If the &lt;b>Hide&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> mode is selected, information records are not received, and the filter by information records is not available.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>If the &lt;b>As&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>of&lt;/> mode is selected, information records are taken as of the document date. If the &lt;b>Latest&lt;/> mode is selected, the latest information records are taken. If the &lt;b>Hide&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> mode is selected, information records are not received, and the filter by information records is not available.</value>
        </title>
        <formatted>true</formatted>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
      </extendedTooltip>
